### Instruction:
Write a Java method that accepts two integers and returns their least common multiple.

### Response:
public static int lcm(int a, int b) {
    int gcd = 1;
    for(int i = 1; i <= a && i <= b; ++i)
    {
        // Checks if i is factor of both integers
        if(a % i == 0 && b % i == 0)
            gcd = i;
    }

    int lcm = (a*b) / gcd;
    return lcm;
}

