### Instruction:
Design an algorithm that computes the Fibonacci numbers.

### Response:
A Fibonacci algorithm can be written using a simple recursive function:

int fibonacci(int n) {
    if (n == 0 || n == 1) {
        return n;
    }
    else {
        return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2);
    }
}

